\ Dogfood: Phase 4 slice 6d. The combinator half of a matched pair with
\ `examples/combinator_in_times_hand.sth`: both build a 3-element array per
\ round and print its elements, one round per outer `times` iteration, one
\ over `each` from `lib/combinators.sth` and one hand-threaded, so the golden
\ can pin them to the same output. This is ROADMAP's own motivating shape for
\ 6d, `2 [ | i | mk [ . ] c::each ] times`: a combinator driving its own
\ internal `times` loop while already inside an outer `times` body, which R18
\ rejected before this slice lifted the limit.

import: c "../lib/combinators.sth" ;

: mk ( i64 -- [i64 3] )
  | base | 0 3 fill | s |
  &!s 0 >usize &!> base !
  &!s 1 >usize &!> base 1 + !
  &!s 2 >usize &!> base 2 + !
  s ;

: main ( -- )
  3 [ | i | i mk [ . ] c::each ] times ;
